1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,400
This is war. It is combat. It is bloody. It is ugly. And it's going to be messy.

2
00:00:07,160 --> 00:00:10,820
And innocent civilians are going to be hurt going forward.

3
00:00:10,920 --> 00:00:14,320
I wish I could tell you something different. I wish that that wasn't going to happen.

4
00:00:15,280 --> 00:00:22,000
But it is going to happen. And that doesn't make it right. It doesn't make it dismissible.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,680
It doesn't mean that we aren't going to still express concerns about that

6
00:00:25,680 --> 00:00:29,820
and do everything we can to help the Israelis do everything they can to minimize it.

7
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:34,260
But that's unfortunately the nature of conflict.

